							"_parent": {
								"$ref": "onDk7oEUX2iukgrKZp9PGw=="
							},
							"fontColor": "#253A54",
							"font": "Microsoft YaHei UI;18;1",
							"parentStyle": false,
							"left": 80,
							"top": 1080,
							"width": 700,
							"height": 35,
							"text": "审计与缓存一致性"
						},
						{
							"_type": "UMLTextView",
							"_id": "+nej+KcLV+Ol9T49HhIxfQ==",
							"_parent": {
								"$ref": "onDk7oEUX2iukgrKZp9PGw=="
							},
							"fontColor": "#253A54",
							"font": "Microsoft YaHei UI;16;0",
							"parentStyle": false,
							"left": 650,
							"top": 1280,
							"width": 1580,
							"height": 135,
							"text": "图例与约束\nPK：主键；FK：外键；N：可空；U：单列唯一。联合唯一约束见表的 Documentation。\n鸟脚端表示 0..*；父端按外键可空性标注 1 或 0..1。虚线表示非标识关系（外键不组成子表主键）。\n蓝：组织与用户；绿：授权；橙：资源与菜单；灰：基础设施。"
						},
						{
							"_type": "UMLTextView",
							"_id": "ZxrskSP2UoiJS+44nJdJnQ==",
							"_parent": {
								"$ref": "onDk7oEUX2iukgrKZp9PGw=="
							},
							"fontColor": "#253A54",
							"font": "Microsoft YaHei UI;16;0",
							"parentStyle": false,
							"left": 1220,
							"top": 910,
							"width": 1020,
							"height": 170,
							"text": "业务约束\n一个用户归属一个部门；授权适用部门由 sys_user_role.scope_dept_id 决定，覆盖该部门及其下级。\n角色的 company_id 为空表示全局角色；部门负责人仅为组织信息，不自动取得管理权限。\n审计日志保留历史快照；actor_id、target_id、granted_by 均不虚构外键。授权版本表为单行表（id=1）。"
						},
						{
							"_type": "UMLTextView",
							"_id": "AVMCWmoqW2W8fYRSBHI6wg==",
							"_parent": {
								"$ref": "onDk7oEUX2iukgrKZp9PGw=="
							},
							"fontColor": "#253A54",
							"font": "Microsoft YaHei UI;16;0",
							"parentStyle": false,
							"left": 1220,
							"top": 1110,
							"width": 970,
							"height": 150,
							"text": "关键联合唯一约束\n部门：(company_id, parent_id, dept_name)\n功能模块：(system_id, module_code)\n权限：(resource_id, action_id)\n角色授权：(role_id, permission_id)\n用户指派：(user_id, role_id, scope_dept_id)"
						}
					]
